<title>ITALY: Parmalat '96 cons profit up, raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Parmalat '96 cons profit up, raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			190    vs   135</p>
<p>    Ord div				15 lire  vs 11 lire</p>
<p>    Total dividend payout		 22.2  vs    12.5</p>
<p>    Net equity			   1,481    vs 1,139</p>
<p>Note - Full name of dairy products and food group is Parmalat Finanziaria.  </p>
<p>    Net financial charges		92     vs     128</p>
<p>    Net debt (end 1996)		 811     vs   1,096</p>
<p>    Parent net profit		    32.3   vs	13.5</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129720</p>
</text>
